  "title": "Coast More, Pay Less: How and where Americans can save on summer beach travel",
  "summary": "The American beach vacation is a beloved summer tradition. Across US beach towns, for example, searches by families for Airbnb stays this summer are up nearly 20 percent. However, traveling to the coast is increasingly out of reach for many families with 79 percent of Americans saying they’re worried about the rising cost of travel, according to a recent survey.",
